            "line": 250,
            "text": "theorem solution_integralEquation (A : Coefficient a b E) (x₀ : E) (f : Curve a b E) :\n    solution hab A x₀ f = constantCurve x₀ +\n      integrator hab (applyCoefficient A (solution hab A x₀ f) + f)"
